# inEnglishWords

- _inEnglishWords(n)_

Answer the integer _n_ spelled out in English words.

```
>> 123_456_000.inEnglishWords
one hundred twenty-three million,
 four hundred fifty-six thousand

>> 13_579.inEnglishWords
thirteen thousand,
 five hundred seventy-nine
```

* * *

See also: printString, storeString

Categories: Printing
